    },
    {
      "text": "Add the cauliflower rice, then mix into the meat. Cover and cook for 5-10 minutes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/middle-eastern-cauliflower-rice-pilaf/#wprm-recipe-59398-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/middle-eastern-cauliflower-rice-pilaf-step-02.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the pilaf is cooking, add the pine nuts to a dry pan and cook until toasted. Be careful that they don't burn.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/middle-eastern-cauliflower-rice-pilaf/#wprm-recipe-59398-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/middle-eastern-cauliflower-rice-pilaf-step-03.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve the pilaf in bowls with the toasted pine nuts on top.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/middle-eastern-cauliflower-rice-pilaf/#wprm-recipe-59398-step-0-3",
